        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-02T00:52:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In the store on this very website</p><p>https://greaterthangames.com/store/category/games</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Big V is currently available for preorder until Monday, I believe is the current deadline for final preorders (to be delivered in Feb).&nbsp; Otherwise, wait until Feb 2014 (which sounds like a long time but is only 4 months at this point) for the regular sales release.</p><p>That said, by preordering you do get 2 promo cards, i think.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
